    "message": "Support for 1.x and 2.x versions has ended. You can continue using this existing version for your current projects. Meanwhile, we encourage you to track the development of the new v3 architecture on GitHub and migrate when appropriate. Please note that v3 is a full redesign and is not API compatible with older versions.",
